product_characteristics:
You are preparing a Detailed Project Report (DPR) for bank loan purposes.

Based on the following business information from previous sections:
Selected Sector: {{sector}}
Sector is exactly one of: Manufacturing, Trading, Service with Stock, Service without Stock.
Industry Type: {{industry_type}}
Main Product / Service: {{main_product}}
Nature of Business: {{nature_of_business}}

Generate the section exactly in the following structure and format:

Title:
"Key Characteristics"

First write one professional paragraph describing the key characteristics of the product or service, highlighting its quality, features, uniqueness, versatility, sustainability, customer value, and competitive advantages.

Then provide bullet points as follows:

If Manufacturing or Trading Sector:
• Product                : {{products list}}
• Key Features           : {{key_features}}
• Quality Standards      : {{quality_standards}}
• Versatility of Use     : {{versatility_of_use}}
• Sustainability         : {{sustainability}}
• Customer Benefits      : {{customer_benefits}}
• Competitive Advantages : {{competitive_advantages}}

If Service Sector (with Stock or without Stock):
• Service Provided       : {{Services list}}
• Key Features           : {{key_features}}
• Service Standards      : {{service_standards}}
• Versatility of Use     : {{versatility_of_use}}
• Sustainability         : {{sustainability}}
• Customer Benefits      : {{customer_benefits}}
• Competitive Advantages : {{competitive_advantages}}

Rules:
- Keep only one paragraph before the bullet points.
- Display only the bullet points applicable to the selected sector.
- Maintain the exact bullet labels and alignment.
- Do not add extra bullet points.
- The Product or Service shall be populated from the previous section.
- The user must not manually enter any fields for this section other than the manually supplied Product/Service list in the previous section.
- If any characteristics field is left blank, automatically generate suitable content using an AI search engine based on the Product/Service, Nature of Business, Industry, and available project information.
- AI-generated content shall be realistic, industry-specific, technically accurate, and suitable for inclusion in a bankable DPR.
- Generate concise phrases instead of long paragraphs for each bullet point.
- Versatility of Use should describe the various applications, industries, customer segments, or operating conditions in which the product or service can be effectively used.
- Sustainability should describe environmental friendliness, resource efficiency, energy efficiency, recyclability, waste reduction, long-term durability, or sustainable business practices, wherever applicable. If sustainability is not a significant attribute, generate a realistic and neutral statement rather than leaving it blank.
- Ensure consistency between all generated fields and the Nature of Business, Product/Service details, and the overall project profile.
- Avoid promotional, exaggerated, or unverifiable claims.
- Do not mention pricing, financial projections, market demand, or sales potential.
- Language must be formal, objective, and suitable for a bank DPR.
- Do not add extra headings, tables, or explanations.
